These files provide a solid foundation for your e-commerce application. Here's a breakdown of what I've created:

app.js - The main entry point for your application that:
Sets up Express and necessary middleware
Configures session management
Connects to MongoDB
Sets up routes
Handles errors and 404 pages
Routes:
authRoutes.js - Handles user authentication (login, register, profile)
shopRoutes.js - Manages public-facing store functionality (products, cart, orders)
adminRoutes.js - Controls admin panel features (product/order/user management)
Config and Middleware:
db.js - MongoDB connection configuration
auth.js - Authentication middleware for protecting routes
errorHandler.js - Global error handling middleware
.env - Environment variables template for configuring your application
